{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ac71cc33fda1605a","name":"Sith Lord Talent Trees","source":{"id":"source:reference-ac71cc33fda1605a","title":"Sith Lord Talent Trees","revision":18498,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:12:58Z","sha256":"2eaebf90551ef0d800c613b89c848b03f1d01ce8cd5b8bdfcfcc4a6517ca86f9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18498","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sith%20Lord%20Talent%20Trees&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ac71cc33fda1605a","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["At every odd-numbered level (1st, 3rd, 5th, and so on), a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lord","referenceId":"reference:099f599e53fbfc32"}," gains an additional Sith Lord Talent. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lord","referenceId":"reference:099f599e53fbfc32"}," may choose a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:02c8fb037b4cc8a5"}," or any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Talent_Tree"}," they wish (including ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tradition Talent Trees"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tradition_Talent_Trees"},"), but they must meet the prerequisites (if any) of the chosen Sith Lord Talent. No ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," can be selected more than once unless expressly indicated.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talent Trees"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TALENT TREE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DESCRIPTION\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:02c8fb037b4cc8a5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," believe in order through tyranny. In ancient days, Sith Warriors battled Jedi Knights for galactic supremacy until, finally, the few remaining Sith were driven into hiding. Since then, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," have conspired to annihilate ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," and everything they stand for.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
